mprovement opportunities;</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#39754e;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">leveraging our export and domestic market access, infrastructure, supply chain expertise and strong customer relationships;</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#39754e;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">leveraging our scale, proximity to mills and logistics to broaden end use markets;</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#39754e;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">increasing our recreational lease revenue and</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="display:flex;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#39754e;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.333%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">continuing to maximize the value of our timberlands portfolio by managing the acres to achieve the highest and best use.</span></div></div></div>
