ns or financial condition or otherwise caused material harm to the company. To date, we have incurred no expenses for penalties or settlements with a</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
