-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">or </span><a href="#consolidated_statement_cash_flows"><span style="color:#0000ff;white-space:pre-wrap;text-decoration:underline solid;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Consolidated Statement of Cash Flows</span></a><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">. We plan to incorporate these expanded disclosures beginning in fourth quarter 2027.</span></p></ix:continuation></div></ix:continuation></div></div>
